# Immich safety

## Read-only default

List albums/assets and search are fine when Immich work is authorized. Do **not**:

- permanently delete assets or empty trash
- create public share links without an explicit verb
- change admin users, OAuth, or API keys
- bulk-retag/move across libraries the user did not name

…unless the user gave an explicit verb this turn naming the object(s).

Prefer trash/archive over hard delete. Never paste API keys into chat.
